; 터널
arc 60.210,36.130 68.264,33.641 17 3
arc 62.920,36.130 68.640,36.130 180 18
arc 65.630,36.130 57.200,36.130 17 3
arc 62.920,121.88 57.575,33.641 7 11
cr 57.200,36.130 58.700,36.130
cr 58.700,36.130 59.420,35.630
cr 59.420,35.630 66.420,35.630
